  "accepted_coverage": [
    "An actual seven-symbol marked tape and finite controller implement in-place paired-bit XOR. Phase logic reads the current symbol rather than observing zipper boundaries. Movement is adjacent, and markers occupy two real cells.",
    "For every finite paired input including n=0, the actual marked step relation reaches first halt in exactly 5*n+4 transitions and returns the head, markers, source bits and initially clean scratch. No halt padding is counted.",
    "The public proof constructs each cell-preservation witness, deriving n+2 represented cells for every prefix k and after halt. This footprint does not include input-format installation costs.",
    "End-to-end zipper_refinement joins both actual completed runs; Nat XOR decoding reuses the accepted predecessor. No lock-step relation or unbounded Nat operation is claimed."
  ],
  "remaining": [
    "Constructing the marked same-width paired input and charging layout/initialization/reset is caller work.",
